    "rating": 3.3,
    "reference": "ChIJszYEETA2yUwRGR10TWcvmLk",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Suzanne T.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103591715396726191099/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJeWOMLMZFEeT9qnMYLtuVf8FAElCh586bBZctRRqK62hGSPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Very disappointed with this store. I love going there to buy clothes, but I will now avoid the one in vaudreuil. Every time I walk in there I hear the blonde worker cussing or talking bad. I understand if you had a bad day but it’s been more than one time! She always has bad attitude and it makes me want to leave right away. It was not directed to me personally but it says a lot about this clothing brand. Since I’ve seen her a lot I’m assuming she’s a manager, which is even worse. I’ve talked to my friends and they have been also experiencing bad costumer service with this young lady. Dynamite, do better.",
        "time": 1766075467,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shica Ras",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104413086161601754753/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsNAUfZXUreF3noOoLrWf4qMgfDGm8of3r_m0L-CcbpYmPtvU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Worst Dynamite and customer service! Been to this store several times now and staff lack interest in greeting clients or asking for help. Thought maybe I was the only one but seems like it was to many that entered the store.\n\nTo add, I brought in items to return and the associate missed one on my refund. I called the store back the next day, as receipts are sent by email and I just happen to check later, they were no help. They asked me to contact customer support. Really?? All that needed to be done was to check for the item I gave in with the SKU and compare to the inventory in store. I'm sure the item was near by the cash as I went near closing hours and called in as soon as they opened. Lack of wanting to help. We're 2 weeks in since the incident and still not resolved.\n\nDefinitely won't be shopping at this location or any Dynamite, as a matter of fact. Just lost a loyal customer unfortunately!",
        "time": 1768584865,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alice G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111884037171542444483/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7tkR9Q5Sy53hvdAj-sGt5DstEPeipGaTVLPUPPqP_FaXVycbp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "No greeting from the staff or help offered, and judging by the other reviews it’s a reoccurring problem. Maybe the root issue is the management who can’t train their employees?\nAlso, the designs are beautiful but the colors are horrific, all kinds of faded beiges and grays. Fabrics are bad as well.",
        "time": 1769179454,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Samira Heidaryan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113310665689445071791/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUk96OOhQk2eAD9FtEf2W_JFgRPlEK6Y30Mzx8gCIlp_u-gY8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "This is by far the worst Dynamite store I've ever been to. The employees are incredibly unhelpful and impolite. Tonight, I went to return a pair of pants that didn’t fit, since I had already purchased a replacement. However, the two girls at the counter refused to process my return in the rudest manner possible and they referred me to return online because it was an online order😐. I’ve been a loyal Dynamite customer in the past, but unfortunately, the Vaudreuil location is the closest one to me and this was not the first negative experience I’ve had with the staff here. After this, I will definitely be shopping elsewhere and no longer even opening the Dynamite's website.",
        "time": 1763084058,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stephanie Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104714491772397624948/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxV5NMF1ALEPU21pA_eELZ8SLfAhNo-BI5EUnTHsvcwSnpcx0k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I was really disappointed with my experience at Dynamite Vaudreuil.\n\nWhen I arrived, all three girls working were just sitting and talking, and no one even said hello. One girl did eventually help me, but after a few minutes, she left me in the waiting room without checking if I needed any other sizes. I had to get dressed again and go find the size I needed myself. Honestly, it felt like I would have received better service if I had just ordered online. It’s frustrating that there’s no focus on customer service anymore.",
        "time": 1729197463,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
